+# Changes
+
+## Round 0
+
+- Added `src/wrap.mjs` exporting `wrap(text, width)`: greedy word wrap that
+  joins lines with `"\n"`, treats any whitespace run as one separator, never
+  splits a word (over-long words go on their own line), trims leading and
+  trailing whitespace, returns `""` for empty/whitespace-only input, and
+  throws a `TypeError` prefixed `wrap:` for a non-string `text` or a `width`
+  that is not a positive integer. JSDoc matches the `countWords` style.
+- Added `tests/wrap.test.mjs` (`node:test` + `node:assert/strict`) covering
+  ACCEPTANCE.md items 3 through 10.
+- Added a `wrap` example to `README.md` alongside the `countWords` example.
